OL,4,A'appalling reading' says first minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FA damning report on the leadership of
OL,7,FGrampian NHS is the focus of Scottish
OL,8,FLabour leader Michael Marra's questions
OL,10,FJohn Swinney says the publication by
OL,11,FHealthcare Improvement Scotland made
OL,12,Ffor "appalling reading" and said
OL,13,F"dramatic changes" are now expected
