OL,4,A'appalling reading' says first minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FScottish Green co-leader Ross Greer
OL,7,Faccuses the government of "doubling
OL,8,Fdown on dependence on oil and gas". The
OL,9,FFM says he is committed to a renewables
OL,10,Ffuture
OL,12,FScottish Conservative leader Russell
OL,13,FFindlay highlights his party's "right
OL,14,Fto stand" bill which if passed would
OL,15,Fmean migrants who do not have permanent
OL,16,Fresidency cannot be elected to
OL,17,FHolyrood. Swinney says "due
OL,18,Fconsideration" would be given to any
OL,19,Fproposed legislation however he
OL,20,Fbelieved such a move was not a
OL,21,Fpolitical priority
